    <node id="Ollama">
      <data key="d0">Ollama</data>
      <data key="d1">Organization</data>
      <data key="d2">Ollama is a Large Language Model (LLM) used for conversational AI functionality in the Discord Bot.&lt;SEP&gt;Ollama is an LLM (Large Language Model) inference engine integrated with the Rajjo Gujjar bot for context-aware conversations.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-75601805fceec3389a50199b8f98ad50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43fd30e3fc7d936d86a26bcb2f0d79c</data>
