      <data key="d1">Software</data>
      <data key="d2">Python is the programming language used to develop and manage various components of the Discord Bot.&lt;SEP&gt;Python is a primary programming language used in building the Rajjo Gujjar bot's functionality.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-75601805fceec3389a50199b8f98ad50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c43fd30e3fc7d936d86a26bcb2f0d79c</data>
